The '''Fishing Festival''' is an [[Event]] that occurs when {{NPCSprite|Marina;Mayor Marina}} is elected as Mayor with her {{AN|Fishing Festival}} active, or when {{NPCSprite|Foxy;Mayor Foxy}}'s {{AN|Extra Event}} perk or {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry;Mayor Jerry}}'s {{AN|Perkpocalypse}} perk is rotated to a '''Fishing Festival'''.

During the '''Fishing Festival''', players are able to fish up '''Sharks''', special [[Sea Creatures]] that drop {{Item|Shark Fin}}s and different varieties of '''Shark Teeth'''.

== Overview ==
=== Timing ===
{{NPCSprite|Marina}} schedules {{Green|12}} '''Fishing Festivals''' throughout the year, occurring on the first {{Green|3}} days of each month.

