Other factors affect the time a '''Fishing Festival''' takes place:

* If {{NPCSprite|Foxy;Mayor Foxy}} is in office with her {{AN|Extra Event}} perk active, a '''Bonus Fishing Festival''' occurs from {{Season|m=LSU|d=22nd}} with the same duration.
* A '''Bonus Fishing Festival''' from {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry;Mayor Jerry}}'s {{AN|Perkpocalypse}} occurs at exactly {{Green|18:00}} on the same SkyBlock day of the beginning of a rotation to perks from Marina (or {{Green|18 hours}} in [[SkyBlock Time]] / {{Green|15 minutes}} in real-life time following the beginning of rotation to perks from Marina). The bonus event has the same duration as a normal Festival.

=== Mechanics ===
During the '''Fishing Festival''', '''Sharks''' have a base {{Green|15%}} chance to replace all Sea Creatures. The chances for '''Sharks''' to replace Sea Creatures can be increased with the following methods:

* {{Green|+1-5%}} from {{NPCSprite|Doug}}'s '''Shark Sonar''' perk
* {{Green|+20%}} from {{Item|Shark Bait}}
* {{Green|+20%}} from {{Item|Shark Scale Armor}}'s {{AN|Festival Fisher}} tiered bonus
* {{Green|+10.1-20%}} from the {{Item|Megalodon Pet|rarity=Legendary}}'s {{AN|Feeding Frenzy}} perk

totalling to a {{Green|+80%}} chance for '''Sharks''' to replace any Sea Creature.

